        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Miki Černák, a boy from Telgárt, became a respected boss of a mafia group. But it is not enough for Černák. He wants to dominate all of Slovakia. Become the boss of all bosses. However, the way to the top is lined with traitors and corpses. And Černák underestimated the strongest mafia that ever ruled Slovakia - politicians and their secret service.",
          "runtime": 109,
          "tagline": "no one escapes the consequences of their actions, not even MIKI",
          "title": "ČERNÁK"
        }
